/*!
\page page_sttriggerdetectorcollection StTriggerDetectorCollection — Collection Documentation

\section tdc_overview Overview

\ref StTriggerDetectorCollection aggregates trigger data from all STAR triggering
sub-detector systems into a single \ref StEvent object.  Each sub-detector is
stored <b>by value</b> (not by pointer), so the destructor is a <b>no-op</b>.

\section tdc_subdetectors Trigger Sub-detectors

| Acronym | Full Name | Role |
|---------|-----------|------|
| BBC | Beam-Beam Counter | Min-bias trigger, start time and vertex-z for p+p. |
| CTB | Central Trigger Barrel | Charged-particle multiplicity trigger at mid-rapidity. |
| MWC | Multi-Wire Chamber | Outer tracking chamber trigger element (early runs). |
| VPD | Vertex Position Detector | Min-bias trigger and start time for heavy-ion. |
| ZDC | Zero Degree Calorimeter | Spectator neutron trigger for heavy-ion minimum bias. |
| EMC | Electromagnetic Calorimeter | High-E<sub>T</sub> and jet triggers (barrel + endcap). |
| FPD | Forward Pion Detector | Forward π⁰/γ trigger for spin physics. |
| FMS | Forward Meson Spectrometer | Extended forward γ/π⁰ trigger coverage. |
| MTD | Muon Telescope Detector | Di-muon (J/ψ, Υ) triggers. |

\section tdc_ownership Object Ownership

All nine sub-detector objects (\ref StBbcTriggerDetector, \ref StCtbTriggerDetector,
\ref StMwcTriggerDetector, \ref StVpdTriggerDetector, \ref StZdcTriggerDetector,
\ref StEmcTriggerDetector, \ref StFpdTriggerDetector, \ref StFmsTriggerDetector,
\ref StMtdTriggerDetector) are stored <b>by value</b>.  No heap allocation;
no pointers to delete.  The collection itself is owned by the \c StEvent framework.

\section tdc_constructors Constructors

| Constructor | Description |
|-------------|-------------|
| Default | All sub-detector members use their own default constructors. |
| \c StTriggerDetectorCollection(const dst_TrgDet_st&) | Populates from legacy DST trigger table (CTB, MWC, VPD, ZDC, BBC, EMC, FPD). |
| \c StTriggerDetectorCollection(const StTriggerData&) | Populates by unpacking \ref StTriggerData (CTB, VPD, ZDC, BBC, EMC, FPD, FMS, MTD). |

\section tdc_methods Key Methods

| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| \c bbc() | Access \ref StBbcTriggerDetector (mutable and const). |
| \c ctb() | Access \ref StCtbTriggerDetector (mutable and const). |
| \c mwc() | Access \ref StMwcTriggerDetector (mutable and const). |
| \c vpd() | Access \ref StVpdTriggerDetector (mutable and const). |
| \c zdc() | Access \ref StZdcTriggerDetector (mutable and const). |
| \c emc() | Access \ref StEmcTriggerDetector (mutable and const). |
| \c fpd() | Access \ref StFpdTriggerDetector (mutable and const). |
| \c fms() | Access \ref StFmsTriggerDetector (mutable and const). |
| \c mtd() | Access \ref StMtdTriggerDetector (mutable and const). |
| \c setXxxTriggerDetector(const StXxxTriggerDetector&) | Replace a sub-detector object by copy assignment. |

\section tdc_example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
StTriggerDetectorCollection* trgColl = event->triggerDetectorCollection();
if (!trgColl) return;

const StBbcTriggerDetector& bbc = trgColl->bbc();
// bbc.adcEast(tube), bbc.tdcEast(tube), ...

const StZdcTriggerDetector& zdc = trgColl->zdc();
// zdc.adcSum(east), ...

const StCtbTriggerDetector& ctb = trgColl->ctb();
// ctb.mips(slat, 0), ...
\endcode

\see StBbcTriggerDetector, StCtbTriggerDetector, StZdcTriggerDetector,
     StVpdTriggerDetector, StEmcTriggerDetector, StFpdTriggerDetector,
     StFmsTriggerDetector, StMtdTriggerDetector
*/
